  <!-- Medic -->
  <string name="Eclipse.Role.Medic">Shaman</string>
  <string name="Eclipse.Role.Medic.IntroBlurb">Create a shield to protect a crewmate.</string>
  <string name="Eclipse.Role.Medic.MedDescription">Shield a player. Attacks on them are stopped.</string>
  <string name="Eclipse.Role.Medic.TabDescription">Shield a player so that attacks on them are stopped.</string>
  <string name="Eclipse.Role.Medic.WikiDescription">The Shaman is a Crewmate who shields other players. While the shield lasts, attacks on the shielded player are stopped: the attacker is told and is left with a short cooldown. The shield ends when the shielded player or the Medic dies, and, depending on the settings, when it absorbs an attack.</string>
